<title>SWITZERLAND: BB Industrie sells Rieter stake.</title>
<headline>BB Industrie sells Rieter stake.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>BB Industrie Holding AG  said it had sold its entire stake of nearly 35 percent in Rieter Holding AG to a consortium comprising unidentified investors and Rieter itself.</p>
<p>It said in a statement it made a profit of more than 60 million Swiss francs on the transaction.  </p>
<p>&quot;BB Industrie Holding has sold its stake in Rieter Holding AG at market prices to a consortium comprising investors and Rieter Holding AG,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>&quot;BB Holding had held a total of 809,986 Rieter registered shares or nearly 35 percent of all outstanding registered shares.&quot;</p>
<p>Rieter confirmed the transaction.</p>
<p>-- Zurich newsroom +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
